{"id":"08147f5acef354b7","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-promise-circuit-size.md","title":"承诺问题的固定规模电路类","display":"df-promise-circuit-size — 承诺问题的固定规模电路类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-promise-circuit-size","aliases":["28-df-promise-circuit-size"],"display":"df-promise-circuit-size — 承诺问题的固定规模电路类","depends_on":["[[28-df-promise-problem]]","[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"source_book_location":"§23.4 before Theorem 23.8","source_printed_pages":"504","source_pdf_pages":"530","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-promise-circuit-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-promise-circuit-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-promise-circuit-size — 承诺问题的固定规模电路类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" href=\"?note=3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" title=\"28-df-promise-problem\">28-df-promise-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§23.4 before Theorem 23.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"504"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"530"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" href=\"?note=3bdfe6bfd8cbf765\" title=\"28-df-promise-problem\">28-df-promise-problem</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>，非输入门数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}(s)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\exists(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;[C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le s(n)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\cap\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\;\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)_1=f(x)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}(s)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\exists(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;[C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le s(n)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\cap\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\;\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)_1=f(x)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用固定逐长度规模上界，无 O(·) 系数隐藏；原书 SIZE(n^c) 的常数约定可由增大固定指数吸收。承诺域可空，此时任何满足规模约束的电路都合格。不同长度的电路完全非一致；域外输出不限。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§23.4 before Theorem 23.8；印刷页 504；PDF 页 530。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-promise-problem","status":"resolved","id":"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-promise-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-promise-problem","status":"resolved","id":"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}$、$\\operatorname{Dom}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-promise-problem]]。$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]，非输入门数 $\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}$、$\\operatorname{Dom}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-promise-problem]]。$\\m